  "details": "There seems to be a regression on Utilities.IsValid() on things that have been destroyed using Destroy()\nThis affects old and new worlds.\nSmall reproduceable example:\npublic class Crasher : UdonSharpBehaviour {\n    public Crashee Crashee;\n    void Start() {\n        Utilities.IsValid(Crashee);\n        DestroyImmediate(Crashee.gameObject);\n        Utilities.IsValid(Crashee); // Crashes here\n    }\n}",
